  "display_name": "Corrosive Clouds",
  "display_fullname": "Dominator Control QUOVapor Control ReactiveCloud",
  "display_help": "You summon a squad of sentient clouds with corrosive properties. The clouds have no actual abilities other than auras, but they are difficult for enemies to target with single target attacks, are highly resistant to slash and lethal damage, and they regenerate health on their own. However, the clouds have no defense against area effect attacks or resistance against attacks based on psionics or elements. Recharge: Very Long",
